    "multicolumn_mAFfnB": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_fbcCbg": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Remanufactured equipment",
            "subtitle": "Parts & Labor valid anywhere in USA and Canada",
            "text": "<p>All remanufactured machines include a 1 year warranty covering parts and on-site labor. We also offer extended warranties of 2, 3, 4, and 5 years parts & on site labor. This will guarantee your machine works like a brand new machine for the period of the warranty. Is your machine squeaking? Heart rate not working? Is the screen not responding quickly? Call us, we will send a technician to your house free of charge.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link": "",
            "label_img": "shopify://shop_images/Award.svg",
            "label_text": "1 year free"
          }
        },
        "column_tXGbUX": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "French Fitness warranty",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>All French Fitness equipment, excluding free weights, flooring, and accessories, comes with a comprehensive 10-year parts warranty and a 1-year labor warranty for customers in the USA and Canada. For gym accessories, free weights, and flooring, a 1-year limited warranty applies, ensuring reliable coverage across a wide range of products.</p>",
            "link_text": "Learn more about French Fitness' warranty",
            "link": "shopify://pages/french-fitness-warranty",
            "label_text": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_fbcCbg",
        "column_tXGbUX"
